      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it just feels so heavy. like there's no point in fighting it when the stillness is the only thing that feels real anymore. sometimes i think about how peaceful it would be to just let go of it all, to just reach that stillness and not have to perform being \"okay\" ever again. does that make sense? that wanting to just stop existing feels more like a relief than a scary thought?",
